Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today is Tulsi Vivah —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the wedding that opens the wedding season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tulsi Vivah is the tulsi plant's wedding to Lord Vishnu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here Vishnu is in his Shaligram form,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's also called Tulsi-Shaligram Vivah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:19.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was Dev Uthi Agiyaras.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's believed the Lord wakes after the four months of Chaturmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, on Kartak Sud Baras,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.57,0:00:28.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,the wedding season begins again with Tulsi Vivah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In homes without a daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:34.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,many families do Tulsi's kanyadaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:37.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does your family? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The wedding is usually this evening, after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:45.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the exact time, check your city's panchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:49.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:50.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
